Nothing further from me on this one. `ffb0860` is the whole change: the validator rejects a `steps_per_epoch` below 1 next to the `update_interval` check you pointed at, the three consumers guard on truth rather than `is not None`, and the empty-dataloader path falls through to the warning instead of raising a `ValidationError` from inside DeepSpeed.

Ready for a maintainer whenever one has time.

